      "title": "A Novel MBSE-Driven Integrated Modeling and Simulation Methodology for Small Satellites Development, (IM3S)",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Salah Eldeen Taha, Amr"
        },
        {
          "name": "Elbayoumi, M"
